        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 374,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 462,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 375,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65803,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 375,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Cervix and/or lower uterine segment</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65804,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Most patients present with vaginal bleeding or a cervical mass.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65805,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Patients with NTRK-rearranged cervical sarcoma range in age from 23 to 44&nbsp;years (mean: 31&nbsp;years) {21317712; 29553955}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65806,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65807,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Other than an association with NTRK rearrangement, the pathogenesis of these neoplasms is unknown.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65808,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>NTRK-rearranged sarcomas are typically firm, slightly fleshy lesions centred in the cervical stroma. They range in size from 3 to 12&nbsp;cm. Similar lesions can involve the uterus.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65809,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>NTRK-rearranged cervical sarcoma consists of a proliferation of predominantly uniform spindle cells with mild to moderate atypia and inconspicuous nucleoli. Scattered atypical symplastic-like cells may be present. The mitotic count is variable (1&ndash;50&nbsp;mitoses/mm<sup>2</sup>). A staghorn vascular pattern and necrosis may be present. To date, no lymphatic or vascular invasion has been reported. The spindle cells express S100, CD34, TRK, and cyclin&nbsp;D1. Importantly, there is no expression of CD10, SMA, desmin, BCOR, ER, or PR {30877273; 21317712}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65810,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 382,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65811,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 382,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Demonstration of NTRK rearrangement is diagnostic.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65812,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> spindle cells with ovoid nuclei and scant cytoplasm; the spindle cells are positive for S100 and CD34; NTRK rearrangement.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65813,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>NTRK-rearranged sarcoma is staged in the same way as other cervical sarcomas.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65814,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 425,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The clinical course of NTRK-rearranged cervical sarcoma is variable, but at least some tumours are associated with metastasis and an aggressive clinical course. Data are limited, but older patients appear to be at higher risk of disease progression. The number of reported cases is too low for prognostic or predictive markers to be defined.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-12T17:25:07"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]